    "Dictionary": {
        "Entries": {
            "zh-cn": {
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_01": "$self$脚心发痒，笑了一声：\"真是的，你怎么这么喜欢摸脚？\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_02": "$self$把视线移向别处，耳根微微发红：\"轻一点……那里很敏感的。\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_03": "$self$轻轻叹了口气，语气带着纵容：\"好吧，仅限今天哦，别弄太痒了。\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_04": "$self$愣在原地，睁大眼睛看着$target$：\"等等……你要做什么？\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_05": "$self$看着握住自己脚踝的那只手，耳根发烫，一时忘了反应：\"那个……怎么突然摸脚……？\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_06": "$self$张了张嘴没发出声音，神情有些无措地任由$target$托着脚。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_07": "$self$浑身发抖，咬住嘴唇不敢叫出声，声音发颤：\"求你……别这样……\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_08": "$self$不敢看$target$的眼睛，紧闭双眼忍着不适：\"我知道了……我不动……\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_09": "$self$脸色发白，脚趾不受控制地蜷紧：\"对不起……对不起……\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Sleep_01": "$self$发出含糊不清的梦呓，本能地蜷了蜷脚趾：\"唔……好痒……别闹……\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Sleep_02": "$self$睡得很沉，只是脚趾偶尔轻轻抽动一下，呼吸依旧平稳绵长。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Sleep_03": "$self$在睡梦中轻哼了一声，足弓微微绷了一下又松弛下来。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_TimeStop_01": "$self$静止在原地，没有任何反应，只有脚趾随着$target$手指的力道微微变形。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_TimeStop_02": "$self$维持着上一秒的姿势一动不动，对脚上传来的揉按毫无知觉。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_TimeStop_03": "$self$像一尊静止的人偶，连呼吸节奏都没有变化，只任由$target$触碰她的脚趾。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_FailPerm_01": "$self$笑着缩了缩脚趾：\"呀！别闹，脚心好痒！\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_FailPerm_02": "$self$摇了摇头，神色有点尴尬：\"不行，今天走了好多路呢……脏。\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_FailPerm_03": "$self$嗔怪地瞪了$target$一眼：\"你是变态吗？今天不想被摸脚啦！\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_FailLike_01": "$self$尴尬地笑了笑：\"呃，这样不太好吧？我们还没熟到这种程度……\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_FailLike_02": "$self$语气礼貌却带着疏离：\"那个，我不习惯别人碰我的脚，抱歉。\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_FailLike_03": "$self$干笑两声，神情有些局促：\"这玩笑开得有点过了哦。\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_FailHate_01": "$self$沉下脸喝道：\"滚开！别用你的脏手碰我！\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_FailHate_02": "$self$满脸嫌恶地瞪着$target$：\"真恶心……把你的手拿开！\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_FailHate_03": "$self$拉下脸，声音里满是鄙夷：\"你有病吧？离我远点！\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_SuccPerm_01": "$self$原本紧绷的脚背放松下来，脚趾轻轻蜷曲：\"嗯……意外地……挺舒服的……\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_SuccPerm_02": "$self$的呼吸变得有些急促，看着$target$笑道：\"再按一下脚心……对，就是那里……\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_SuccPerm_03": "$self$发出一声轻哼，声音带着点懒意：\"你倒是越按越顺手了。\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_SuccNoPerm_01": "$self$原本绷着的脚慢慢松了下来，脸颊泛红：\"奇、奇怪……怎么觉得还挺放松的……\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_SuccNoPerm_02": "$self$咬着嘴唇，耳根发烫，小声嘀咕：\"……随你吧，别捏太重就行。\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_SuccNoPerm_03": "$self$不好意思地别过脸去，脚趾却不再缩着：\"别一直盯着看啊……\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_BadPerm_01": "$self$有些恼火地瞪着$target$：\"够了！一直弄那里真的很奇怪啊！\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_BadPerm_02": "$self$脸上的笑意消失了，语气生硬：\"我说了很痒……你听不懂吗？\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_BadPerm_03": "$self$叹了口气，神色带着不满：\"好无聊……捏够了没有啊。\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_BadNoPerm_01": "$self$忍无可忍地冲$target$喝道：\"放开我！你这个变态！！\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_BadNoPerm_02": "$self$眼眶发红，恨恨地盯着$target$：\"我绝对……不会原谅你……\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_BadNoPerm_03": "$self$满脸厌恶，声音发哑：\"碰够了吗？真让人恶心……滚啊！\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_Sleep_1": "$target$托起熟睡中的脚，把脚趾一根根捏过，$self$在梦里痒得蜷了蜷脚趾，没醒。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_Sleep_2": "脚心被指腹轻轻按揉，$self$含糊地嘟囔了一声，呼吸依旧平稳绵长。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_Timestop_1": "$target$托起悬在半空的脚，把脚趾逐根捏过，$self$的脚保持着原本的弧度，没有任何反应。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_Timestop_2": "脚心被指腹轻轻刮过，$self$的脚趾没有蜷缩，只是停在原处任由摆弄。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_Sleep_3": "脚趾被轻轻揉捏着，$self$只是动了动脚踝，眼皮一直没抬。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_Timestop_3": "脚趾被分开又松手，$self$站在原地一动不动，目光仍停在原来的落点上。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_fainted_1": "脚趾被反复揉捏，$self$始终昏迷着，没有半点醒来的迹象。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_fainted_2": "$self$没有恢复意识，脚底被搓热了也依旧毫无反应。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_fainted_3": "无论$target$怎么拨弄脚趾，$self$都闭着眼一动不动。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_restrained_succ_1": "$self$原本蜷紧的脚趾慢慢松了下来，别过脸闷声道：\"……好痒，别老挠脚心。\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_restrained_succ_2": "被绑着没法躲，$self$小声嘀咕：\"……力道倒还不重。\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_restrained_succ_3": "脚上的酸胀被揉散了些，$self$垂下视线不再咬牙硬撑。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_restrained_fail_1": "脚趾被捏得生疼却抽不回脚，$self$气得眼圈发红：\"轻点！弄疼我了！\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_restrained_fail_2": "$self$咬着牙瞪向$target$，语气发哑：\"趁人被绑住摸脚，真够恶心的……\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_restrained_fail_3": "$self$浑身绷紧，声音里带着火气：\"别再扯我脚趾了，疼死了！\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_woken_1": "$self$迷迷糊糊睁开眼，低头看见$target$正捏着自己的脚：\"唔……你捏我脚趾干嘛呀？\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_woken_2": "被脚上的痒意弄醒，$self$打了个哈欠，倒没怎么生气：\"好痒啊，难怪梦里一直觉得不对劲。\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_woken_3": "$self$刚醒过来，声音还有点沙哑：\"醒了醒了，别挠脚心了。\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Refuse_woken_1": "$self$刚一醒过来就沉下脸瞪着$target$：\"趁我睡着摸别人脚趾，变态啊你！\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Refuse_woken_2": "被弄醒的$self$拉下脸，语气生硬得很：\"把你的手拿开，恶心死了！\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Refuse_woken_3": "$self$还没彻底清醒就已经拉下脸斥道：\"滚远点，别乱碰！\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Refuse_Receiver_1": "$self$避开了$target$的触碰，不满地皱起眉。\n\"别随便碰我的脚趾。\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Refuse_Receiver_2": "$self$把$target$的手推开。\n\"我现在不想被碰脚趾，请自重。\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_Fainted_1": "$self$毫无知觉地昏迷着，脚趾被$target$捏住时没有任何反应。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_Fainted_2": "脚心和趾缝被轻轻碰触，$self$仍闭着眼一动不动，呼吸声轻弱而平缓。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_Fainted_3": "$self$完全失去了意识，任由$target$把玩自己的脚趾。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_Restrained_1": "$self$被绑着动弹不得，只能蜷紧脚趾咬牙道：\"别碰我的脚……\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_Restrained_2": "手脚都被制住，$self$狠狠瞪着$target$，呼吸一下子急了。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_Restrained_3": "$self$无力挣开束缚，偏过脸去不看那只握着自己脚踝的手。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Ongoing_Player_1": "$self$余光瞥见$target$在一旁看着，脸颊一热，不好意思地把视线移向别处。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Ongoing_Player_2": "被摸着脚趾时撞上$target$的目光，$self$耳根发烫，冲对方摆了摆手示意别看了。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Ongoing_Player_3": "$self$小声冲站在旁边的$target$抱怨：\"喂，这有什么好看的，别一直盯着。\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Ongoing_NPC_1": "$self$蜷了蜷脚趾，冲$target$笑道：\"捏够了吧？脚都让你搓热了。\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Ongoing_NPC_2": "揉捏停下后，$self$看着$target$调侃道：\"就这么喜欢摸脚啊？\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Ongoing_NPC_3": "$self$语气带着点羞恼对$target$说道：\"行啦，下次别老往脚心上挠。\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_Receiver_1": "$self$顺从地配合着$target$的动作。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Ongoing_Fallback_1": "$self$脚尖微微蜷了蜷，仍安静地待在原地。",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_10": "(unimplemented)",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_1": "(unimplemented)",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_2": "(unimplemented)",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Ongoing_1": "(unimplemented)",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Refuse_1": "(unimplemented)",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Refuse_2": "(unimplemented)"
            },
            "en-us": {
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_01": "$self$ felt ticklish and couldn't help shrinking her foot back, but immediately extended it again with a doting smile. \"Seriously, do you like this place that much?\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_02": "$self$ didn't pull her foot back but looked away, the tips of her ears turning red. \"Gently... it's very sensitive there.\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_03": "$self$ gently rubbed the back of $target$'s hand with her other foot, as if silently permitting the act. \"Alright, just for today, okay?\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_04": "$self$ froze completely, eyes wide open, as if her brain hadn't processed the situation yet. \"Wait... what are you doing?\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_05": "$self$ stared at the hand gripping her ankle, completely forgetting to resist, only her toes curling awkwardly on the ground. \"Umm... my shoes...?\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_06": "$self$ opened her mouth but was too shocked to make a sound, simply staring blankly as $target$ manipulated her foot.",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_07": "$self$ trembled all over, biting her lip desperately to stifle a scream, tears welling up in her eyes. \"Please... don't do this...\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_08": "$self$ clutched her skirt tightly, not daring to look $target$ in the eyes, closing her own in despair. \"I understand... I won't move... please finish quickly...\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Begin_09": "$self$'s foot spasmed uncontrollably in $target$'s hand, her face pale. \"I'm sorry... I'm sorry... I'll listen...\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Sleep_01": "$self$ mumbled incoherently in her sleep, frowning slightly, instinctively trying to pull her foot back under the covers. \"Mmm... ticklish... stop it...\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Sleep_02": "$self$ slept soundly, only her toes twitching slightly with the movement, her breathing remaining steady and long.",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_Sleep_03": "$self$ seemed to feel something strange in her dream, turning over uneasily, one leg unconsciously draping over $target$, the arch of her foot tensing for a moment before relaxing.",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_TimeStop_01": "$self$ remained frozen in mid-air with no reaction, only the soft flesh between her toes deforming under $target$'s touch.",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_TimeStop_02": "$self$ maintained her walking pose perfectly still, only the skin on her sole turning slightly red from the warmth of the touch.",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_TimeStop_03": "$self$ was like an exquisite doll, feeling nothing as $target$ slid fingers deep between her toes, not even a reflex twitch occurring.",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_FailPerm_01": "$self$ retracted her foot as if electrocuted, accidentally kicking $target$ in the process. \"Eek! Stop it, it tickles!\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_FailPerm_02": "$self$ pressed her toes against $target$'s palm, frowning slightly. \"No, I walked a lot today and haven't showered yet... it's dirty.\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_FailPerm_03": "$self$ nimbly pulled her foot away, sitting cross-legged on the sofa to guard her ankles. \"Are you a pervert? Let go!\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_FailLike_01": "$self$ smiled awkwardly, trying to discreetly pull her foot back. \"Uh, isn't this a bit inappropriate? We aren't that close yet...\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_FailLike_02": "$self$ gently pushed $target$'s hand away, her tone polite but distant. \"Um, I'm not used to people touching my feet, sorry.\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_FailLike_03": "$self$ shrunk back, maintaining social distance. \"This joke is going a bit too far, haha.\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_FailHate_01": "$self$ unceremoniously kicked towards $target$'s face, eyes cold. \"Fuck off! Don't touch me with your dirty hands!\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_FailHate_02": "$self$ stood up abruptly, slapping the spot that was touched with a look of disgust. \"Disgusting... I'm calling the police!\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_FailHate_03": "$self$ looked at $target$ like garbage, her voice filled with contempt. \"Are you sick? Get away from me!\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_SuccPerm_01": "$self$'s previously tense instep relaxed completely, her toes curling unconsciously in $target$'s palm. \"Mmm... unexpectedly... it feels quite good...\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_SuccPerm_02": "$self$'s breathing became somewhat rapid, looking at $target$ with hazy eyes. \"Press the sole again... yes, right there...\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_SuccPerm_03": "$self$ let out a soft hum, actively offering her other foot. \"Here too... don't be biased.\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_SuccNoPerm_01": "$self$'s resistance gradually ceased, her cheeks flushing an unnatural crimson, breathing becoming heavy. \"S-strange... why does it...\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_SuccNoPerm_02": "$self$ bit her finger, eyes losing focus as her pushing hand dropped weakly. \"Haa... whatever... do as you please...\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_SuccNoPerm_03": "$self$ covered her face in shame, but her toes honestly gripped $target$'s finger. \"Don't look at me... Ugh... only the feet... feels good...\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_BadPerm_01": "$self$ jerked her foot back, glaring at $target$ with some irritation. \"Enough! It's really weird to keep doing that there!\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_BadPerm_02": "$self$ stopped smiling, her tone stiffening. \"I said it tickles... don't you understand?\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_BadPerm_03": "$self$ tapped $target$'s shoulder annoyedly with her foot. \"So boring... I'm going to sleep, let me go.\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_BadNoPerm_01": "$self$ finally snapped, screaming hysterically and kicking wildly. \"Let go! You pervert! Crazy!!\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_BadNoPerm_02": "$self$'s fear turned into pure hatred, staring deathly at $target$. \"I will absolutely... never forgive you...\"",
                "com_touch_foot_toes_BadNoPerm_03": "$self$ retched from extreme disgust, face pale. \"Touched enough? I want to vomit... Get lost!\""
            }
        }
    }
}